# What prettier must not touch.
#
# The pre-commit hook runs `prettier --write` over every staged js/json/html/
# css/md file. On a file prettier has never formatted, that is not a tidy-up -
# it is a whole-file rewrite. One commit here reformatted 11,516 of the 11,920
# lines of frontend/modules/settings_write.html to add a form, which buries the
# change and takes git blame with it. The two commits before it touched that
# same file surgically, 2 lines and 42 lines, which is what review needs.

# Vendored from the Posnic/QR repository. It has to stay byte-comparable with
# its source so the copy can be diffed and re-synced; reformatting it here
# makes every future sync a manual merge.
order/

# Hand-written jQuery-era markup and modules. Prettier rewrites these wholesale
# and they are edited constantly, so blame matters more than style here.
frontend/modules/
frontend/layouts/
frontend/modals/
frontend/static/script/
frontend/*.html

# Written by the i18n tools, which have their own formatting and rewrite these
# on every run. Letting prettier reformat them starts a war between the two.
languages/

# The app test suite: 143 of its 145 files are not prettier-formatted, so the
# hook rewrites whole files the first time anyone touches one. These tests are
# mostly prose explaining what broke and why the check exists, and that history
# is worth more than uniform quote style.
#
# api/ is deliberately NOT here: it has its own prettier config and its files
# really are formatted, so the hook does the small job it was meant to do.
tests/

# Build output, never source.
frontend/public/
dist/
builds/
node_modules/

# The desktop shell. Prettier has never formatted it, so the hook rewrites the
# whole file: a 25-line change to src/main.js came back as 2,254 insertions and
# 1,505 deletions, which buries the change and takes git blame with it. Same
# reason as frontend/ above, and the same fix.
src/

# Generated by the frontend build maps, one entry per line by hand. Prettier
# reflows the whole file, so adding one script reads as 349 changed lines.
frontend/pages_css_js_map.json
frontend/pages_html_map.json
